<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Qolaasiyasa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Qolaasiyasa Asayis xaafeez Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Qolaasiyasa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Qol.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Qolaasiyasa Asayis Xaafeez Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Qolaasiyasa asayis xaafeez kiitay xaafintteezay, Xiqqa Iisa, Efisonepp awa kess baggar yez Qolaasiyasa katamay yez woosa keethatisii. Ye woosa keetha esseezay Phawuloosa baa maaqqikokka, Oroome biitta Iisass waanna katama maaqqeez Efisonapp Wonggile sabaakita kiittizay eza maaqqeez gishos Qolaasiyasasayilakka adetithi ees yeza. Qolaasiyasa woosa keetha, «Xooss erodayisinnee kunth atotith denggodayis as ubbay ayyana wolqqitayisinnee mawutayis goynnodayis koshshiza» yeegiz worddo asitamaaritay yezana Phawuloosa si7eeza. Ye asitamaaritay taamarssiza hara baz, ma, «Asii ubbay dookkalintto yeegiz azazo wogitayis moodinttodayisinnee muuss woga ubba naagodayis koshshiza» yeegiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa yha kiita xaafeezay, tuma ammano timirtta tamaarssii, u worddo timirtta laalodayisii. E maheez mahithitaypp waannatizay, «Yesuus Kiristtoosa kunth atotith inggiza; zin yha hara haymaanotitayinnee u oositay eepp haakithiza» yeegizaya. Xoossay Kiristtoosa baggar alame medheeza. Ma e baggar mahii faako ko7oda. Yha alamayis atotith ufayssi yezay Kiristtoosa ammano baggara. Yeyi gishos, Phawuloosa yha gita timirtta ammaniza as de7o wayizii oosol peeshshodayis beezizako odiza. Yha kiitannee Efesoona asayis xaafeez kiitay, fa aykkeez qofayrannee kiitay woli aaziza. Yha nam7i maxaafitay gancce yez dummatithay, Efesoone Kiristtoosa woosa keethis kustte yeegiza, zin Qolaasiyasa Kiristtoosa medhetithis kustte yeegiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yha kiita Phawuloosapp ekkii Qolaasiyasa hellodayis yhanigeez Tikiqoosar wolla yezay Anasmoosa maaqqeezana beezos maaddiza baz. Wayizii giiko, Phawuloosa Anasmoosa ginttinttiz fa oosanchchay bagga Filmoonas hara kiita xaafeeza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Qolaasiyasa kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa hanannee oosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:9-2:19">1:9—2:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosar yez oroth de7o <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 2:20-4:6">2:20—4:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssith sarothonnee kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Xooss shener Kiristtoosa Yesuusa hawaare maaqqeez Phawuloosapennee nu isha Ximaatoosapp, <verse eid="COL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>Qolaasiyasa katama yez Kiristtoosas ammanintteez geeshshitayis xaafeez kiita.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Xoossa nu Aday aadho keehatithaynnee sarotithay yinttis maaqqo.<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Galata woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Nuunii yinttis woossittar Xoossa nu Goda, Yesuus Kiristtoosa Ada ubba wode galatiza. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>Nuunii Kiristtoosa Yesuusar yez yi ammanannee geeshshitayis ubbayis yez yi siiqa si7eeza. <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>Yi tuma kiitta maaqqeez Wonggile tiina ammaneez wode ye ufayssa si7eeza. Yeya yi ootheezay yi ufayssay salo yinttis naagintteez gishosii. <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>Yi yha Wonggila si7eez wodennee Xooss aadho keehatith tumatitha shaakkii ereez wodepp aykkii yi gancce haneezay garkk biitta ubbayid daligittarannee aafittar yeza.<verse eid="COL 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/>Yi yeya nuur wolla Kiristtoosas oothiza ammanintteezannee, dosintteez Ephafirapp tamaareeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Qol. 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Film. 23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>E yeyil afa gujjii Ayyanay yinttis inggeez siiqor yi woli qadhdhizana nuus odeeza.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Yeyi gishos, nuunii yi baz si7eez gallasaypp aykkii, Xoossay fa shena yinttan beezoday garkke, Geeshsha Ayyanay inggiza eratithirannee ecetith ubbayir yinttan kunthoday garkk ubba wode yinttis Xooss woossizana ashaamii. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Yey garkkekka, Goday koyizay garkk yi yezod garkk, ubba wode e ufayttoday garkk, lo77o ooso ubbayid yi aafe aafod garkkennee Xoosse aathii erittar diccoday garkk Xoossa woossiza.<verse eid="COL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>Xoossay fa gita wolqqayir minotith ubba yinttis inggo. Yi danda7arakka garzhoday garkk ufayssar giigintteezita maho. <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>Ma Xooss asita poo7o kaatetitha laattoday garkk yinttan ootheez Xooss Ada galatooytta. <verse eid="COL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>E nuna dhuma wolqqapp shaakkii ashshii fa dosiza na7ay kaatetitha geloday garkk udeeza. <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/>E wozin nu nu nagarayis atotithi denggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efi. 1:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa dhoqqatith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Kiristtoosa benttowa Xoossayis tuma aaziso. E medhetith ubbitaypp aadho gitanne bayira. <verse eid="COL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Ubba baz e baggar medhintteeza. Benttizibazitayinne benttowabazitay, wolqqitayinnee godittay, moddizitayinnee mawute aditay, salonnee sa7a yez ubbita Xoossii e baggarannee ees medheeza. <verse eid="COL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>E ubbabazapp kase yeza. Ubba baz kiristtoosa baggar fa aqo aqo aykkinttii eqqeeza. <verse eid="COL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/>E fa asetith maaqqeez woosa keethayis kustte. E ubbaypp aath maaqqodayis yhayiqopp dendor tiinannee bayra.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Efi. 1:22-23</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Xoossii fa kunth Xoossatithay fa na7ay gancce yezodana koyeezay Xooss Aday shene maaqqeez gishosi yeykka haneeza. <verse eid="COL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/>Ma mazqalel afa laaleez fa na7a suuthayir sarotithi medhdhii salonnee sa7a yez ubba e baggar paar dabbotheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Efi. 2:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Yhaypp tiina yi qofayinnee yi ooso iitatithay yinttan Xoossapp shaageezannee ees morkkita udeeza. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Zini yhatti Kiristtoosa ashor yhayqqeez yhayiqay baggar Xoossii yinttan paar iginthii, geeshshita, bore baazitannee xillita udeeza. <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Yi, yi ammanor eni7ekka miinggii xaphphii yezodayis beeziza. Yi Wonggile qaala si7eez wode ekkeez ufayssa miinthii aykkoytta. Ye Wonggila yi si7eezannee alame ubbayil sabbakintteeza. Ta, Phawuloosakka yha Wonggelayis oosanchcho maaqqeeza.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa hawaaretith ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Taanii yi gishos yhatti ekkiz metay ufayssiza. Kiristtoosa e asetithi maaqqeez woosa keethatis ekkodar facceez meta taanii ta ashayil poloda. <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>Xoossa qaala yinttis wurssii ododay garkk taas inggintteez mawutayir woosa keethis oosanchcho maaqqeeza. <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>Yha qaalay binii aadheez laythitayid yeletith ubbaypp geenggii gam7eeza. Zini yhatti Xoossii yha xuura ammaniza ubbayis qoncciseeza. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Xoossii Ayihude maaqqeez asay gancce yha xuura bonchcho duretitha qoncciseeza. Eekka bonchcho ufayss maaqqeez yi gancce yez Kiristtoosa.<verse eid="COL 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Yeyi gishos, pettii pettii asa Kiristtoosar kunth as udii shiishodayis ecetith ubbayir asa tamaarssorannee zorer Kiristtoosa bagga sabbakiza. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Xoossii fa damma wolqqar taal oothiza gishos yhanno hellodayis e wolqqar butitizannee daaburiza.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Ta yinttisinnee Loodoqa katama yez asayis, yhay garkk tana aafer be7ekka as ubbayis ab garkk butitizako yi erod garkk koyiza. <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>Ta butitizaykka unttii fa wozinayir miinggii, siiqor acinttii, folo maaqqeez kunth akaaka duretith denggii Xooss xuura Kiristtoosa erod garkkesii. <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>Erethinnee ecetith shalo ubbay qosinttii yezay kiristtoosara.<verse eid="COL 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Ta yeya giza oonkka yinttan doosha qaalar balthaam garkkesii. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Ta yinttipp haakkii yezikokka ayyanar yinttar yeza. Yi yessay wogannee Kiristtoosa yi miinggii ammanizana bi7in tana ufayssiza.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosar yez kunth yess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Yi Goda Kiristtoosa Yesuusa ekkeezan garkk ezar yezoytta. <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>Ezal xaphoytta; ezal keexxinttoytta. Yi tamaareezan garkk ammanor miinggoytta; Xoossayis kumii puceez galata ingoytta.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Kiristtoosapp baazin as wogarannee yha alamay cere wogal eqqeez as eretithar medhdhii keseez timirttiyarannee cere dooshshar oonkka yinttan balithii di77amay garkk naaginttoytta. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Xooss Xoossetith folo kunthetithay asetithar qonccii yezizay Kiristtoosara. <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>Yinttikka mawutesinnee wolqqa ubbayis kustte maaqqeez Kiristtoosar kunth de7o dengeeza.<verse eid="COL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Yi Kiristtoosana ammanor dookalintteeza. Yeykka as kusher baazin yi iita nagarara kumeez hanotith haasiz Kiristtoosar oosintteez dookalintto. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/>Yi xammaqintteez wode Kiristtoosar wolla mooginttii, Kiristtoosa yhayiqopp dentheez Xooss wolqqa ammanii, Kiristtoosar wolla denddeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Oro. 6:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/>Yi, yi nagara gishonnee yi ceega asetitha dookalinttekka gishos yhayqqii yezin, Xoossii yi nagara atto geeza. Kiristtoosar yinttis de7o inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Efi. 2:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>E nu mootannee nuur eqinttiza, nuul afa xaafintteez aco xuufa peedhii mazqalel afa mikinttii ogepp taageeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:15">Efi. 2:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Kiristtoosa wolqqitannee mawute adita mazqalel gamii, u dancca bili7isii, di7intteez as garkk udii unttan qoncce kessii beezeeza.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>Yeyi gishos, miizibazar woy uzhiz bazar, agina xeeriza qamma woy maala bonchcho bagga oonkka yinttal afa pirddippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Oro. 14:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Yeyititay tiinapp ye7odayis yeza bazitayis eesho, zin ubbay Kiristtoosa. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>Qoodhepp qommo haayotithinnee kiitanchchos goynnor ceeqinttiza oonkka yinttan yi woyitaypp ashshippe. Yey garkk asii fa be7eez qonccithar sabinttittar fa asho qofar cere utirttiza. <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/>Yey garkk asayis kustte maaqqeez Kiristtoosako shiiqo baaya. E asetitha ubba shashsharannee woli helthii aythii muzii dichchiza. Xoossii yey garkk oger asetitha ubba dichiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:16">Efi. 4:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oroth Yess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Yi Kiristtoosar yhayqqii yha alama haariza ayyanitay wolqqapp wozintteeza. Yeezin, abis shakkinttekka as garkk maaqqii yha wogitayis moodinttee? <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>Yha wogitay, «Aykkippe; laa7ippe; bochchippe» ginttinttizita. <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Yha ubbay as wogannee timirtte maaqqeez gishos oosol afa peezheezaypp guye dhabodayis yeza. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Yha azazitay asii fa ubba qofapp medhdheez goynno, aqopp aadheez haayotihtinnee asetitha qohor erintto unttis ecetith aaziza, zin nu iita amotith haarodayis unttis wolqqa baaya.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Oroth de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>Yikkee, yi Kiristtoosar yhayiqopp dendeezaygarkk, Xoossaypp ushachch bagga betteez Kiristtoosa yez aqo, salo yezabazita koyoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Salo yezitayil afa yi qofa gaddoyttapp attin sa7a yezbazibazitayil afa gaddippate. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Yhayiqor shaginttizay garkk yi yha alame iita hanopp shaakintteeza. Yi de7ay Kiristtoosar wolla Xooss gancce qosintteeza. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Yinttis de7o maaqqeez Kiristtoosa qoncciz wode ye wode yinttikka ezar bonchchor qonccoda.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Yey gishos, yinttal yez yha sa7a asho qofita wodhoytta. Yeyititaykka lagite, tunatithii, lagites tenttito, eeqas goynno garkke maaqqeez amotithii. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Yeypp denddeezayid Xooss kachchay azazinttowa asayil afa ye7oda. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Yinttikka tiina ye iita ogayir yedhdhitar yhayttita ootheeza.<verse eid="COL 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Yhatti maaqqiko yi yeyitita oothippate. Yeyititaykk kachchii, yilo, genennee borsso nashsha yinttipp haasoytta. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/>Ceega hanotitha e oosayir yinttipp qaareez gishos wolis wordditipatte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efi. 4:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/>Medhizaya aaziz, eretithar laamintteez oroth hanotitha ma77oytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Medhe. 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:24">Efi. 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Yha oroth medhetithayir, Girike as woy Ayihude as, dookalintteezay woy dookalinttekkazay, tamaareez as woy tamaarekka as<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Iskute as: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guusay wozina mino as woy wozina iita as guussii.</char></note> aylle woy godi baaya. Kiristtoosa ubba; E ubbayidakka yeza.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>Yeyi gishos, Xoossii maraxeez as garkk geshetithar dosintteezita maaqqii, maarotith, qadhe, ashikketith, haayotith keehatithinnee danda7a ma77oytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:2">Efi. 4:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>Woli danda7oytta. Oonkka fa laggaypp qohintteez baz yeeziko ees atto goytta. Goday yinttis atto geezay garkk yinttikka wolis atto atto goytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Efi. 4:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Ye ubbayil afar ubba baz wolalli shiishii acciz siiqo ma77oytta. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Xoossii yinttan pettii as udii xeegeezay, sarotethis maaqqeez gishos Kiristtoosa sarotithay yi wozina haaro. Galatar kumeezita maaqqoytta.<verse eid="COL 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Kiristtoosa qaalay yi wozinayid kumii yezo. Ecetith ubbar woli tamaarssoyttannee zoroytta. Mazmuurer, sabarannee ayyana yethar Xoossa wozinapp galatittar yexxoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19-20">Efi. 5:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Xooss Ada Yesuusa baggar galatittar yi odinttiza woy oothizabaz ubba Goda Yesuusa sunthayir oothoytta.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammaniza as kara yess wogga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>Machchitayyo, Goday tiina beeziza baz maaqqeez gishos yi azinitayis azazinttoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efi. 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Phix. 3:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>Azinitayyo, yi machchita dosoytta; unttis iitipatte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efi. 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Phix. 3:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>Na7itayyo, yinttan yeleezitayis ubba bazar azazinttoytta; yeyi Goda ufayssizabazii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efi. 6:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>Yeleezitayo, yi na7itay ufayss gachchaamay garkk unttan yilosippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efi. 6:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>Ayllitayyo, sa7all afa yinttis god maaqqeezitayis ubba bazar azazinttoytta. Goda bonchchittar luule wozinapp kiitinttii unttan ufayssoyttapp attin asii bo7o gi oothippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efi. 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Yi oothiza ooso ubba asis baazin Godayis oothizaygarkk wozinapp oothoytta. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Godaypp salo biitta woyito udii naggodana eroytta; yi Goda Kiristtoosas oothiza. <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/>Xoossii as aafe zoqo bi7ii pirddoowa gishos oonkka iita ooso oothiko fa iita oosay gishos mahith ekkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efi. 6:5-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>Goditayo, yinttiskka ma salo Godi yezana erii, yi ayllitayis xillotitharannee petta pettaypp shaakkekkazar aqisoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efi. 6:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Xoossa miinggii galatittar gachchekkazar woossoytta. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>Xoossii fa qaala penga dooyoday garkkennee taanii e gishos acintteez Kiristtoosa xuura markkatod garkk nuuskka woossoytta. <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>Ma taakka beezizay garkk qaala qonccis ododay garkk taas Xoossa woossoytta.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>Woda wozittar ammanoowa asay lanqqe ecetithar yezoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:16">Efi. 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Yi as ubbayis koshshiza mahith erod garkk yi nashshay ubba wode aadho keehetithar kumeezannee maxine garkk mal7iza baz maaqqodayis beeziza.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>Nu siiqo ishay Tikiqoosa, taar wolla Goday oosayid aylle maaqqeez, ammanintteez oosanchchay, ta yess bagga yinttis odiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Haw. O. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Xim. 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Taanii eza yinttiko kiitteezay, nu wayizii yezako yinttis odii yinttan minthathoday garkkesii. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/>Anasmoosa, ammaninttiza siiqo ishay, yi baggay, eza yinttiko kiiteeza. Unttii yhaydda haniza baz ubba yinttis ododa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Film. 10-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>Taar wolla accintteez Arisxirokoosannee Barnnabaasa ishay na7ay Marqqoosa, yinttan saro yeegiza. Ta yinttis tiina odeezay garkk Marqqoosa yinttiko yhanigiko eza mokkoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Haw. O. 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film. 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Haw. O. 12:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15">15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Iyasu giz Yasxxoosa yinttan saro yeegiza. Xooss kaatetith gishos taar oothiza asay ganccepp Ayihude maaqqeezitay u aadda. Unttikka tana minthatheeza.<verse eid="COL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>Yi dabbo, Kiristtoos Yesuusa aylle, Ephafira yinttan saro yeegiza. E yi Xooss tiina miinggii eqqod garkkennee Xooss shene erii poloday garkk ubba wode Xoossa yi gishos woossiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Qol. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Film. 23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>E yi gishos Loodoqannee Hirapoolisa katama yez asay gishos iita daabureezana ta markkattiza.<verse eid="COL 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/>Nu siiqo ishay akime Luqaasannee Deemaasa, yinttan saro yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2 Xim. 4:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film. 24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Loodoqa yez nu ishitayisii, Nimfaasinnee I kara shiiqiza asayis nu sarotha odoytta.<verse eid="COL 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Yha dabdabba yi nabbabeezaypp guye, Loodoqa woosa keetha nabbabisoytta. Yinttikka Loodoqa woosa keethay yinttis dakkiz dabddaabba nabbaboytta. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/>Ma Arkkiphaasana, «Goday nees inggeez oosa polodana dogippe» yeegii qofisoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Film. 2</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Taanii, Phawuloosa, yha sarotha ta kusher xaafeeza. Ta achcha yezana qoppoytta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Xooss aadho keehatithay yinttar maaqqo.<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
